# HPAC safety-report — focused coding-agent skills and role agents.
#
# Skills and agents are managed declaratively so every contributor and agent
# gets the same setup from `skillfile install`. Installed copies land in
# `.claude/` and are gitignored; `Skillfile.lock` reproduces upstream sources
# exactly.
#
# A skill is knowledge, loaded when its topic is in play. An agent is a role,
# and it constrains what its holder may do. Four are the steps of the
# specification-driven chain, each trusting only the artifact from the step
# before it (ADR-0086); ai-author maintains these instruction files (ADR-0121).
#
# Search before authoring: `skillfile search "<topic>"`. Prefer maintained
# upstream guidance only when it matches the repository. Local skills are
# generic where the practice transfers, with a project skill holding the
# HPAC-specific knowledge and repository-specific contracts. `/features` is the
# product-design authority.
#
# Docs: https://github.com/eljulians/skillfile

# install  <platform>  <scope>
install  claude-code  local

# --- Agents ---
# github  agent  [name]  <owner/repo[@ref]>  <path-or-dir>  [ref]

local  agent  agents/ai-author.md
local  agent  agents/database-administrator.md
local  agent  agents/implementer.md
local  agent  agents/spec-author.md
local  agent  agents/spec-reviewer.md
local  agent  agents/test-writer.md

# --- Skills ---
# github  skill  [name]  <owner/repo[@ref]>  <path-or-dir>  [ref]

# General documentation and ADR practice; local delivery rules are stricter.
github  skill  addyosmani/agent-skills  skills/documentation-and-adrs

# Focused language and test workflow guidance. Repository-local skills override
# generic details such as assertion library and product architecture.
github  skill  github/awesome-copilot  skills/csharp-async

# Red, green, tidy. Write the test before the code.
github  skill  obra/superpowers  skills/test-driven-development

# Declarative Gherkin scenario design and anti-patterns; framework-agnostic —
# features/*.feature has no step definitions, so only the authoring guidance
# applies, not the execution-framework parts of this skill.
github  skill  thebushidocollective/han  plugins/tools/cucumber/skills/cucumber-best-practices

# --- authored in this repo (source of truth lives under skills/) ---
# The anonymization skill tells coding agents what contract to preserve. The
# actual runtime prompt lives with the Worker and is sent to the model when a
# report arrives.
# Names are explicit: every source file is called SKILL.md, so without a name
# they would all infer the same one and overwrite each other on install.
# Generic skills name nothing specific to this repository, so another project
# can reuse them; tools/check-generic-instructions.mjs enforces it (ADR-0131).
local  skill  clarify-requirements  skills/clarify-requirements/SKILL.md
local  skill  coding-conventions  skills/coding-conventions/SKILL.md
local  skill  deliver-change  skills/deliver-change/SKILL.md
local  skill  design-ef-core-model  skills/design-ef-core-model/SKILL.md
local  skill  manage-ef-core-migrations  skills/manage-ef-core-migrations/SKILL.md
local  skill  postgres-dba  skills/postgres-dba/SKILL.md
local  skill  test-from-scenarios  skills/test-from-scenarios/SKILL.md

# Project skills. One that extends a generic skill names it and keeps its
# section names; hpac-role-agents extends the five role agents.
local  skill  anonymize-hpac-reports  skills/anonymize-hpac-reports/SKILL.md
local  skill  build-hpac-web-ui  skills/build-hpac-web-ui/SKILL.md
local  skill  deliver-hpac-change  skills/deliver-hpac-change/SKILL.md
local  skill  handle-hpac-media  skills/handle-hpac-media/SKILL.md
local  skill  hpac-role-agents  skills/hpac-role-agents/SKILL.md
local  skill  hpac-safety-conventions  skills/hpac-safety-conventions/SKILL.md
local  skill  incident-domain-model  skills/incident-domain-model/SKILL.md
local  skill  localize-hpac-app  skills/localize-hpac-app/SKILL.md
local  skill  manage-hpac-infrastructure  skills/manage-hpac-infrastructure/SKILL.md
local  skill  manage-hpac-migrations  skills/manage-hpac-migrations/SKILL.md
local  skill  persist-hpac-data  skills/persist-hpac-data/SKILL.md
local  skill  test-hpac-safety  skills/test-hpac-safety/SKILL.md
